    "body": "It isn't necessarily about the code point category. Titlecasing is more complicated than just the explicit mappings, since some languages use digraphs and titlecase them in different ways (compare Serbian `dz` and Dutch `ij`). Anyway, happy to add a reference. Where should it point? Unicode glossary?",
