    "body": "It's also where in theory we could bring in references from Unicode (it's both Encoding and Unicode after all). Would need an equivalent paragraph and list.\r\n\r\nI'm not entirely sure how I feel about referencing the i18n glossary or the Character Model as those documents feel like they're summarizing more authoritative sources and I'd rather we reference the latter.",
